# FORM8 UI work

At the start of visual work on this repo, read `.cursor/skills/form8-ui-stack/SKILL.md`
and load the skills it lists for the task (anti-slop, product UI, copy, audit,
references; plus modals/motion when relevant).

Also use installed craft skills as needed: `refero-design`, `emil-design-eng`,
`frontend-design`, `impeccable`, `ui-ux-pro-max`, `copywriting`, `copy-editing`,
`review-animations`, `improve-animations`.

Do not apply Anthropic brand colors. FORM8 tokens win: `#0D0F12`, sparse `#00f948`,
`font-display`, quiet plaque CTAs — not neon glow stacks.
